Comment: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:21.78,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:28.79,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The battle of Solomon had come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:54.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Space Attack Force,\Ncommanded by Vice Admiral Dozle...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:56.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...was effectively obliterated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:02:01.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a defeat that the Principality of Zeon\Nhad been unable to anticipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.07,0:02:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sovereign Degwin Zabi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...is said to have told Gihren that\Nthis should have been expected of Dozle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:17.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While containing his anger\Nagainst the Sovereign...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Gihren made a declaration\Nto the ranks of Zeon's high officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.67,0:02:24.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He would use the stronghold\Nof A Baoa Qu as the final line of defense...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and defeat the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.61,0:02:46.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing to report\Nwithin the second battle line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:49.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No enemy vessels... no mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:54.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:56.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're switching in 30 minutes, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:58.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro is here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please check his blood pressure for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oscar, Marker, and Amuro\Nare all holding up well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.97,0:03:13.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must be hard with all the things\Nthey're asking you to do, Fraw Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing compared to what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:18.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since the two of us stopped talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we've been so preoccupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:29.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The computer analysis says you're healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:33.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro... You've become so strong, it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:35.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.43,0:03:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're far beyond my reach now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:44.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you being weak, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We all have to grow up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry... Fraw Bow... I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.55,0:04:01.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... did something happen at Side 6?\NIt seems you've changed, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:04.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:06.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you someday,\Nwhen I figure out what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:12.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A lot happened there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:14.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:16.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perfectly healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is Hayato coming along?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.59,0:04:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's right on track,\Nthanks to his athletic background.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a problem...\NIt's the Texas shoal zone region.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should we wake everyone up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Sorry to wake you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:30.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:33.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a Chivvay at the edge\Nof the third combat line, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...there seem to be others in the Texas zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On a mopping-up operation of enemy\Nvessels that escaped from Solomon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.49,0:04:43.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the White Base enters the Texas zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.89,0:04:46.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is a shoal zone filled with debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This colony was originally built\Nfor leisure and raising livestock...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and was named Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was abandoned due to\Nits lack of military significance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:05:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's now surrounded by drifting rocks\Nand colony debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:05.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haven't the Elmeth and bits\Nbeen delivered to Texas yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:07.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fine-tuning is taking some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind.\NAt least my own Gelgoog has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:14.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone here at Texas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.15,0:05:15.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:20.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems there are some former workers\Nand staff at the colony's management office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:21.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the colony is practically uninhabited.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:22.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about the Trojan Horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M'Quve is nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have no weapons on hand,\Nso let him deal with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:32.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be docking the Zanzibar at Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:41.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Chivvay is moving.\NThey've noticed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Wake up the whole crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:45.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enemy approaching!{\i}\N{\i1}Enemy approaching!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All hands to level 3 battle stations!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:52.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was such a nice bath, especially\Nafter barely escaping with my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:06:00.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy probably escaped from Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll launch the Guncannon\Nas soon as we reach the second battle area!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:05.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands, we may have survived\NSolomon, but stay on guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to work and get tired a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:16.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm here for you, if you ever want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:20.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you...\NIt's good to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:29.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just as I'd planned.\NWe've found the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:32.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uragang! What's the status of my Gyan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:34.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:37.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good... Proceed now to Area Two,\Nthen launch the Rick Doms!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:39.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll sortie with my Gyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.29,0:06:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's no reason you should\Ngo out in person, Captain M'Quve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:49.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:55.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The mobile suit Gyan was developed\Nespecially for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:59.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must maintain my standing as a man\Nto Rear Admiral Kycilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I hear that Char still\Nhasn't received the mobile suit he requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll demolish the Trojan Horse\Nand the Gundam while he watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:13.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should be able to locate the Chivvay\Nin the second battle area. Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trojan Horse detected at Point 3-AA!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All hands to battle stations!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:24.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rick Doms, make a preemptive strike{\i}\N{\i1}on the enemy fighter-bombers!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you see the Gundam,\Nlure it into Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That'll make it easier for the Gyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:31.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:34.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good! Then move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:42.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here they come... Ms. Sayla, the Chivvay!\NIt'll come into view soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marker, what are the enemy's movements?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see through the debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:00.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maximum magnification ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:05.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the enemy after the G-Armor...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.05,0:08:13.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uragang! I'm counting on you\Nto stall the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:15.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just one ship,\Nbut don't relax your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger, Captain. All clear for takeoff, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:30.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do everything as per the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:33.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll set a trap near Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:36.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember, it's a two-rank promotion\Nif we defeat the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're coming, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:48.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See that, Amuro?\NAre there 4 or 5 mobile suits?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the Minovsky particles\Nand all the rocks, it's hard to tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, can you shoot them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:59.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry and bolt out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:12.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:19.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:38.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Dom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:42.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam and G-Fighter\Nare drifting toward Texas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai! Standby to take off!\NAll hands to level 1 battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:50.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Petty Officer Sunmalo.\NHas another battle begun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just concentrate on getting better, Hayato.\NThat's part of your duty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand that, but my injuries\Naren't as bad as we thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be up and about in a couple of days,\Nso just rest up until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to be a dashing hero, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:07.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look dashing as a healthy patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.22,0:10:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't make things difficult for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:16.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This colony's a sad sight\Nwith its mirror adjustment problems...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:17.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything's dried up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's it going, Flanagan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.27,0:10:25.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's doing well. Lalah hit the test targets\Nwith 70 percent accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:26.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose we should return to the Zanzibar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:31.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here at the Texas colony,\Nbuilt for cattle raising and leisure...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the mirrors were damaged in the war,\Nand stopped working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:36.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The colony has remained in twilight\Nfor over 8 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The land has thus turned to desert,\Nand the people have moved away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:45.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something's coming.\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming here? What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I sensing...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:54.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Flanagan! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:10:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not one of the test targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen her brain waves resonate\Nlike this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there somebody like me around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah. What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:18.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels like you touched my heart, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:22.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah. Don't joke around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That tingling sensation just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:34.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those pilots are experienced!\NBut I can read their pattern!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam and G-Fighter\Nhave entered the Texas area!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is the starboard fleet doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No changes. They're progressing slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:11:58.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.59,0:12:05.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This whole thing was a scheme\Nto lure me toward this mobile suit...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to me... Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:30.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:33.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Talk about devious...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for expecting everyone\Nto fight fair and square, Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:04.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's escaping into Texas?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:59.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:02.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At you, Captain. Does that bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.27,0:14:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:06.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I can pilot the Elmeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.87,0:14:08.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:08.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:11.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll just have to get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll always be by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:17.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you'll be a better pilot than me\Nin no time, Lalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:19.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Better than the Red Comet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:27.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I wouldn't have sent\Nan orphan like you to the Flanagan Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:32.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I left you feeling lonely at Side 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:42.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain! Captain M'Quve has entered Texas\Nin his mobile suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M'Quve? How odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never knew he had this side to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear he's had a mobile suit developed\Nfor his own personal use...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:55.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and he's sworn to bring down\Nthe Trojan Horse. He must feel confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:58.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's simply trying to spite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't think of any other reason\Nfor him to do something so foolhardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:05.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless...\Nwe can't sit still and watch, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gelgoog's maintenance is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:10.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a prototype, so it's hardly perfect, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then this will double as a field test\Nwhile I keep an eye on M'Quve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:20.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:31.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy vessels!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:38.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow! Send out the Guncannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:40.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many vessels, Marker?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:41.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One Chivvay, two Musais!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:15.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.61,0:16:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know. I've memorized the data\Non the Gelgoog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Won't you at least wear a normal suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my policy to come back\Nwith my mobile suit in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I rely on my survival instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I never wear combat suits\Nor normal suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:32.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.18,0:16:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.37,0:16:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These small-scale bombs won't hurt me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:39.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Observe from a safe distance, Lalah.{\i}\N{\i1}This is a battle between mobile suits.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:47.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:59.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then. Show me what you've got, M'Quve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:07.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,3... 2... 1... Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Baromel...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use those rocks to shield the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:26.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:41.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does he have good instincts,\Nor is he one of those new types of human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:45.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A friendly mobile suit...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:47.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A red mobile suit...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.28,0:19:01.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it Char?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char! Pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not your mission\Nto defeat the Gundam right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't stand idly by\Nand ignore an ally in obvious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:42.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have my own way of fighting!\NThat's why I lured the Gundam here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it to you, Captain M'Quve.\NLook out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.77,0:19:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've confirmed it with the data I've collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:59.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've used up too much beam energy\Nin your skirmish with Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:30.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was hoping that the Gundam\Nwould get rid of him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.91,0:20:33.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But M'Quve's putting up a good fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah, you're watching this, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.11,0:20:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why won't the Captain go and help out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:48.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the same thing I felt earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Put your sword away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:02.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your dirty tricks are no match\Nagainst Gundam's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to put Char in his place...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:06.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I have to defeat the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:13.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop already. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:28.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uragang! Deliver that antique vase\Nto Lady Kycilia!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:43.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's priceless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:49.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So hastily prepared, you can't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.57,0:21:59.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:21.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.14,0:22:23.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody's watching me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.61,0:22:39.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.63,0:22:44.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1563)}It isn't Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:55.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A... {\alpha&HFF&}mu... ro...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:22:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A... mu...{\alpha&HFF&} ro...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.61,0:22:57.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A... mu... ro...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.27,0:22:58.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La...{\alpha&HFF&} lah...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.98,0:23:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La... lah...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.13,0:23:21.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For Amuro, who is on the verge\Nof acquiring a new strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.09,0:23:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Char poses virtually no threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.41,0:23:28.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As the fierce battle continues,\NSayla asks Char in earnest...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.01,0:23:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will he leave Zeon behind\Nand finally return to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.84,0:23:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NChar and Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.91,0:23:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
